<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Metaheuristic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "High-level algorithmic procedure, composed of interconnected metaheuristic components, that finds sufficiently good solutions to optimization problems by searching through vast solution spaces."@en .
